    {
      "text": "Key: frames = trust/deployment zones; box = runtime actor/process; cylinder = stored state; double border = external\nservice. Arrows: caller → recipient, response included; dotted = local command/I/O; solid = sync. Flow type is also written on\neach arrow.",
