      "renderedSize": 6.8026001177502495
    },
    {
      "text": "A live handle is returned with no new\nspawn. Missing account →\nNOT_FOUND; empty → NEEDS_LOGIN.\nSupervisor errors (e.g.\nKEY_UNAVAILABLE) go to the error\nfile; exit or 60s → INTERNAL.",
      "renderedSize": 6.8026001177502495
