    {
      "text": "Source: src/session.ts",
      "renderedSize": 5.830800100928785
    },
    {
      "text": "Autosave is best-effort",
      "renderedSize": 6.8026001177502495
    },
    {
      "text": "Every 30s (configurable, 0 = off), on\nSIGUSR2 (crumb sync) and\nSIGTERM/SIGINT it saves a merged\nsnapshot; errors are only logged.\nClosing the window exits with no final\nsave.",
